OL,3,AWill I get the #100 energy payment and
OL,4,Awhen will I receive it?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 20 million households in England
OL,7,Fwill get a #100 payment directly into
OL,8,Ftheir bank accounts this winter, the
OL,9,Fgovernment has announced.
OL,11,FHere's what you need to know about the
OL,12,Fpayment.
OL,14,FFor many people, the #100 on offer is a
OL,15,Flot of money, but it's worth
OL,16,Fconsidering the context.
OL,18,FA typical yearly energy bill is
OL,19,Fforecast to jump by #276 in January, so
OL,20,Fmany people will still feel worse off
OL,21,Fdespite the payment.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
